---
import SectionHeading from "../SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="pb-16 sm:pb-20">
  <SectionHeading id="about" title="About" />
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">
    <p>
      I&apos;m a full-stack developer. I build <strong class="font-medium text-foreground">business web apps</strong>
      and <strong class="font-medium text-foreground">founder MVPs</strong> — software that takes a manual
      process and makes it run itself.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most teams don&apos;t need more software. They need the right software: the spreadsheet
      that becomes a real tool, the workflow that stops living in someone&apos;s head, the MVP
      that finally gets in front of users. I work end to end — shaping the product, building
      it, and shipping it.
    </p>
    <p class="text-primary">
      Available for new projects. <a href="#contact" class="underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Let&apos;s talk →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
